                <head>Agreement between the United States and the Dominican Republic approving a
                    memorandum of understanding dated May 20, 1943, respecting the purchase by the
                    United States of exportable surpluses of Dominican rice, corn, and peanut
                    meal</head>
                <p>[For text of the agreement, effected by exchange of notes, signed at Ciudad
                    Trujillo June 10, 1943, see Department of State Executive Agreement Series No.
                    350, or 57 Stat. (pt. 2) 1142.]</p>
